TruFor-go is a Go reimplementation of TruFor, which is intellectual property of the
Image Processing Research Group of University Federico II of Naples ('GRIP-UNINA').

The upstream TruFor software (https://github.com/grip-unina/TruFor) is distributed
under the following terms, which this reimplementation carries over:

